WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.628 --> 00:00:03.741
Check the request

2
00:00:03.741 --> 00:00:05.854
that will go out,

3
00:00:05.854 --> 00:00:08.837
then predict the result.

4
00:00:08.837 --> 00:00:11.448
You can send once you

5
00:00:11.448 --> 00:00:13.685
pick a prediction.

6
00:00:13.685 --> 00:00:15.093
The same request reaches

7
00:00:15.093 --> 00:00:16.736
the five approaches at once:

8
00:00:16.736 --> 00:00:18.496
firewall, sign-in, fixed rule,

9
00:00:18.496 --> 00:00:19.728
approval-record rule,

10
00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:20.432
and Contexa.

11
00:00:20.432 --> 00:00:22.588
Contexa holds the response

12
00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:23.998
while it decides;

13
00:00:23.998 --> 00:00:26.071
nothing leaves meanwhile.

14
00:00:26.071 --> 00:00:27.149
On the right,

15
00:00:27.149 --> 00:00:29.719
the facts it checks against the

16
00:00:29.719 --> 00:00:32.124
usual pattern and the company

17
00:00:32.124 --> 00:00:34.446
records light up one by one.

18
00:00:34.446 --> 00:00:38.070
Each bar is the data a kind of

19
00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:41.694
security actually handed over.

20
00:00:41.694 --> 00:00:43.748
A red bar leaked;

21
00:00:43.748 --> 00:00:47.614
an empty bar means nothing left.

22
00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:51.841
The log below keeps each step

23
00:00:51.841 --> 00:00:54.464
with its real time

24
00:00:54.464 --> 00:00:58.254
since the request arrived.

25
00:00:58.254 --> 00:01:00.171
Contexa's judgment

26
00:01:00.171 --> 00:01:02.088
is one of allowed,

27
00:01:02.088 --> 00:01:04.537
extra check or blocked.

28
00:01:04.537 --> 00:01:06.241
Send it yourself

29
00:01:06.241 --> 00:01:08.264
to see this result.
